## Notes

- Prefer `T.max(v,-v)` not `T.abs` (CF5/CF6).
- CF2 remat+shared-kill ~2× CF1 KEEP k8 µs (1.95 vs 0.97) — publish tax visible.
- CF5/CF6 gold uses rtol=2e-5 atol=1e-6 (not strict 0.5 ULP).
